The system must evaluate SKU-to-line allocation efficiency by:
Comparing SKU performance across eligible lines
Identifying SKUs running below potential on suboptimal assets
Quantifying benefit of reassignment
Output:
Recommended line reallocation scenarios
Expected throughput gain
Expected scrap and overfill reduction
Watchouts & Risk Alerts
System must automatically flag:
SKUs with persistent GS deviation > 10%
Lines with chronic underperformance vs asset class
Operators/shifts with high variance
SKUs with structural packaging incompatibility
