Objective Function (Phase 2)
Maximize:
Throughput – Changeover Loss – GS Deviation Penalty
Where:
Throughput = Expected units produced
Changeover Loss = Sum of SKU-to-SKU transition time
GS Deviation Penalty = Difference from GS benchmark performance
Objective function weights must be configurable.
